# Extracted Requirements for Implementing My Books Page

## General Overview
To develop a comprehensive web application named 'VirtualBookPublishing' that allows users to publish virtual books, showcasing their content and author details, with no SQL database requirements, utilizing a local text document for data storage.

## Software Functional Requirements
1. Users shall be able to view a list of their published books on the My Books Page.
2. Users shall be able to view the details of any book by clicking the View button next to each book in the list on the My Books Page.
3. Users shall be able to see the title, author, and content of a selected book on the Book Details Page.
4. Users shall be able to navigate back to the My Books Page from the Book Details Page.

